//! End-to-end alternative-witness tests for every v0.3 uniqueness gadget
//! (RFC-0009 'Testing Strategy', `07 §4`, #124, #129).
//!
//! For each gadget (`Requant1`, `RequantSplit`, `RequantWide`, `NonNeg`, `BigIntCompare`,
//! `SoftmaxRow`, `RsqrtRow`, `OneHot`, `Argmax`), this suite verifies:
//! 1. Honest witnesses pass all prover/verifier stages (`LogUp`, product forests, sumcheck, and
//!    `tv_core::gadgets` final checks).
//! 2. Every alternative witness generated by [`tessera_gadgets::malicious`] is rejected both in
//!    the honest proving pipeline and with `GadgetError::Rejected { gadget }` (`REJ-GADGET`)
//!    carrying the exact canonical [`GadgetId`] at the `tv_core::gadgets` final check.
//! 3. The malicious witness generator hook is compiled out when `debug_assertions` is disabled
//!    (release builds; OBS-4).

